#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_t.html.heex:33
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "With the lock, only owners and operators can change it. Half-operators, voiced users and regular members get an error."
msgstr "With the lock, only owners and operators can change it. Half-operators, voiced users and regular members get an error."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_n.html.heex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "With the mode set, the refusal says that the channel does not accept external messages."
msgstr "Avec le mode défini, le refus indique que le canal n'accepte pas les messages externes."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_t.html.heex:26
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Without the lock, any member of the channel can set a new topic with %{command}."
msgstr "Sans le verrou, n'importe quel membre du canal peut définir un nouveau sujet avec %{command}."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channels.html.heex:27
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "You can add a short goodbye after the channel name. Everyone in the channel sees it."
msgstr "You can add a short goodbye after the channel name. Everyone in the channel sees it."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/channels.html.heex:59
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "You can be in a limited number of channels at once. The default is 10, and the server administrator can change it."
msgstr "Vous pouvez être dans un nombre limité de canaux à la fois. La valeur par défaut est 10, et l'administrateur du serveur peut la modifier."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/mode_p.html.heex:62
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A channel cannot be private and secret at the same time. To switch, remove secret mode first, then set private mode:"
msgstr "A channel cannot be private and secret at the same time. To switch, remove secret mode first, then set private mode:"

